sections.content:
Pokazatelji rada za Krista, poručuje Grebenar, su rezultati, „njih ili ima ili nema“. Tu tvrdnju potkrepljuje nizom usporedbi iz svakodnevnog života:

- **košarkaš**: statistika koševa, skokova i ukradenih lopti;
- **nogometaš**: postignuti golovi, precizna dodavanja, centaršutevi, osvojene lopte i dueli;
- **poduzetnik**: završni financijski izvještaj, poslovni rezultat i zaduženost;
- **zdravlje**: nalazi krvi, mokraće i tlaka.

Za katolika i kršćanina pokazatelji ovise o tome je li u kleru ili u obitelji. Voditelj ih nabraja: ima li obitelj, ima li djecu, koliko je ljudi obratio i koliko ih je zbog njega došlo Kristu.

Postavlja i pitanje koja su njegova djela za Gospodina, i vidljiva i neopipljiva, duhovna. Je li izvana obnovio crkvu? Kao načelnik općine, je li izgradio ceste, mostove i staze? Posebno ističe primjer poticanja poduzetništva. Načelnik bi, umjesto velike tvornice s 200 do 300 radnih mjesta, mogao radije imati 50 do 70 OPG-ova i obrta u selu, kako bi se ljudi bavili poduzetništvom i ne bi bili „radnička klasa“. Tako bi njegovo selo postalo poduzetničko, a ne radničko. „Ima mnogo načina kako se može biti Božji“, zaključuje Grebenar.

sections.content_en:
The indicators of working for Christ, Grebenar conveys, are results, „either they exist or they do not“. He supports that assertion with a series of comparisons from everyday life:

- **basketball player**: statistics of points, rebounds, and steals;
- **soccer player**: goals scored, precise passes, crosses, balls won, and duels;
- **entrepreneur**: final financial report, business result, and indebtedness;
- **health**: blood, urine, and blood pressure tests.

For a Catholic and Christian, the indicators depend on whether he is in the clergy or in a family. The host lists them: whether he has a family, whether he has children, how many people he has converted, and how many have come to Christ because of him.

He also raises the question of what his deeds for the Lord are, both visible and intangible, spiritual. Did he renovate a church on the outside? As a municipal mayor, did he build roads, bridges, and paths? He particularly emphasizes the example of encouraging entrepreneurship. The mayor, instead of a large factory with 200 to 300 jobs, could rather have 50 to 70 family farms and crafts in the village, so that people would engage in entrepreneurship and not be the „working class“. In that way, his village would become entrepreneurial, not working-class. „There are many ways in which one can belong to God“, concludes Grebenar.

sections.content:
Završivši tumačenje, Grebenar najavljuje raspored promocija. Toga dana, u srijedu 28. listopada, nalazi se u **Drnišu**, u svečanoj dvorani na adresi Put svetog Ivana 7. Raspored za ostatak tjedna:

- **četvrtak** – Sinj, hotel Alkar, Vrlička 50;
- **petak, 30. listopada** – Ljubuški, hotel Bigeste, Hrvatskih branitelja 69;
- **subota, 31. listopada**, uoči Svih svetih – Prozor-Rama, dvorana hidroelektrane Rama.

Poziva slušatelje da preuzmu banere s Facebook stranice Ora et Labora i podijele ih na svojim mrežama. Objašnjava da na promocije dolazi i otprilike trećina ljudi koji ne slušaju podcast i „maltene ne znaju“ za njega. Netko ih dovede i oni se obrate. Neki se, kaže, jave tek nakon nekoliko mjeseci i priznaju da ih je izgovoreno dotaklo, da su o tome mjesecima razmišljali i da se u njima nešto prelomilo.

Nadovezujući se na to, Grebenar zahvaljuje Bogu i za braću i sestre koji mu osobno ukazuju da nešto nije dobro i da treba popraviti. Za sljedeći tjedan najavljuje:

- **ponedjeljak, 2. studenog** – Biograd na Moru, hotel Ilirija, Tina Ujevića 7;
- **utorak, 3. studenog** – Solin, hotel President;
- **srijeda, 4. studenog** – Imotski, Pučko otvoreno učilište.

Promocije u Istri, u Umagu i Pazinu, ipak neće održati. Doznao je da se u Pazinu održava duhovna obnova i ne želi joj „raditi problem“. Naprotiv, potiče sve da odu na nju. Ne zna o čemu je riječ, ali su mu rekli da obnovu vodi „svećenik baš Božji, Gospin“. Grebenar priznaje da to zna njegova supruga te dodaje da vjeruje njoj i drugima koji svjedoče.

sections.content_en:
Having finished the interpretation, Grebenar announces the schedule of book promotions. On that day, Wednesday, October 28, he is in **Drniš**, in the ceremonial hall at Put svetog Ivana 7. The schedule for the rest of the week:

- **Thursday** – Sinj, Hotel Alkar, Vrlička 50;
- **Friday, October 30** – Ljubuški, Hotel Bigeste, Hrvatskih branitelja 69;
- **Saturday, October 31**, on the eve of All Saints' Day – Prozor-Rama, hall of the Rama hydroelectric power plant.

He invites listeners to download banners from the Facebook page Ora et Labora and share them on their networks. He explains that roughly a third of people who come to the promotions do not listen to the podcast and „practically do not know“ about it. Someone brings them and they convert. Some, he says, reach out only after several months and admit that what was spoken touched them, that they thought about it for months, and that something broke through inside them.

Following on from that, Grebenar thanks God also for brothers and sisters who personally point out to him that something is not good and needs to be improved. For the following week he announces:

- **Monday, November 2** – Biograd na Moru, Hotel Ilirija, Tina Ujevića 7;
- **Tuesday, November 3** – Solin, Hotel President;
- **Wednesday, November 4** – Imotski, Pučko otvoreno učilište.

The book promotions in Istria, in Umag and Pazin, will nevertheless not be held. He learned that a spiritual retreat is being held in Pazin and does not want to „cause a problem“ for it. On the contrary, he encourages everyone to go to it. He does not know what it is about, but they told him that the retreat is led by a „priest truly of God, Our Lady's“. Grebenar admits that his wife knows this and adds that he trusts her and others who testify.
